title: "Market Oracle: Commodity Price Forecasting Ensemble"
abstract: "Commodity price prediction pipeline for the Mitsui Commodity Prediction Challenge, combining a 9-model ensemble (Chronos, NeuralProphet, NeuralCDE, Mixture-of-Experts, Temporal Graph Attention, Granger causality, regime detection) via a Bayesian meta-ensemble with confidence intervals."
